    goals: "Heal ulcer, eradicate H. pylori, relieve symptoms, prevent recurrence and complications",
    pharm: "1. First-line H. pylori eradication therapy per Kenya guidelines: Triple therapy for 14 days: Omeprazole 20mg BID + Amoxicillin 1g BID + Clarithromycin 500mg BID. 2. Continue Omeprazole 20mg daily for 4-8 weeks total for ulcer healing. 3. If penicillin-allergic: Omeprazole 20mg BID + Metronidazole 400mg BID + Clarithromycin 500mg BID (or Tetracycline 500mg QID + Metronidazole 400mg TID + Bismuth + PPI).",
